stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active : issued with grant
    Active --> Rotated : presented once, successor issued, response sealed for 30 s
    Active --> Expired : idle 14 days or family 30 days
    Active --> Revoked : logout, revoke, password change, admin
    Rotated --> Rotated : replay inside grace by same client and key, identical response returned
    Rotated --> FamilyRevoked : replay after grace, or after the successor was used
    Rotated --> [*] : family expires
    FamilyRevoked --> [*] : every token in the grant dead, alert raised
    Revoked --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
